SUMMARY:[現場] Festival of Lessons & Carols
LOCATION:Memorial Church
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/lessons_carols
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/lessons_carols\n\nAll are wel
 come to this service of Advent and Christmas readings and music\, based on
  the famous Lessons and Carols Service held annually at King's College\, C
 ambridge. Festive music will be sung by the Memorial Church Choir and the 
 Stanford Chamber Chorale.\n\nDoors open at 6:30 pm.
END:VEVENT
