BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stanford-53613550873705@didiowen
DTSTAMP:20261006T223216Z
DTSTART:20261122T220000Z
DTEND:20261122T230000Z
SUMMARY:[現場]  Public Tour | Cantor Highlights in Spanish
LOCATION:Cantor Arts Center
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/public-tour-cantor-highlights-spanish
 -language-7060
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/public-tour-cantor-highlights
 -spanish-language-7060\n\nExplore the Cantor's collections with a museum e
 ngagement guide who will lead you through a selection of works from differ
 ent cultures and time periods.\n\n Participants are welcomed to participat
 e in the conversation and provide their thoughts on themes explored throug
 hout the tour but are also free to engage at their own comfort level. \n\n
  Tours do not require a reservation and are free of charge. Please check-i
 n at the visitor services desk in the main museum lobby. \n\n_____________
 ______________________________\n\nExplora las colecciones del Cantor con u
 n guía que te guiará a través de una selección de obras de diferentes 
 culturas y épocas.\n\nLos participantes están muy bienvenidos a particip
 ar en la conversación y aportar sus ideas sobre los temas explorados a lo
  largo de la visita si lo desean.\n\nLas visitas no requieren reserva prev
 ia y son gratuitas. Se ruega registrarse en el mostrador de atención al v
 isitante del vestíbulo principal del museo. \n\n ¡Esperamos verte en el 
 museo!
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stanford-54127815708604@didiowen
DTSTAMP:20261001T232425Z
DTSTART:20261213T213000Z
DTEND:20261213T223000Z
SUMMARY:[現場] Dr. Robert Huw Morgan: Holiday Organ Concert
LOCATION:Memorial Church
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/dr-rhm-holiday-organ-concert
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/dr-rhm-holiday-organ-concert\
 n\nUniversity Organist Dr. Robert Huw Morgan presents a program of festive
  organ works celebrating the season. \n\nFree admission. Donations will be
  accepted to continue organ concerts at Memorial Church. For questions rel
 ated to the event\, please contact stanfordorsl@stanford.edu.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stanford-53994312442198@didiowen
DTSTAMP:20261027T121643Z
DTSTART:20261107T010000Z
DTEND:20261107T030000Z
SUMMARY:[現場] First Fridays at IDA (Social)
LOCATION:Harmony House
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/first-fridays-at-ida-social
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/first-fridays-at-ida-social\n
 \nJoin us at Harmony House for IDA’s monthly First Fridays! A gathering 
 space for artists\, students\, and community to connect\, unwind\, and cre
 ate together. Each month\, we open our doors at the Harmony House  for an 
 evening of conversation\, art-making\, and chill vibes over food and drink
 s. Whether you’re here to meet new people\, share your work\, or just ha
 ng out\, First Fridays are a chance to slow down and be in creative commun
 ity.
END:VEVENT
