BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stanford-53994406476584@didiowen
DTSTAMP:20260917T025843Z
DTSTART:20270305T180000Z
DTEND:20270306T030000Z
SUMMARY:[現場] The 2027 William & Louise Greaves Filmmaker Seminar
LOCATION:Harmony House\, Various Locations at Stanford University
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/2025-greaves-filmmaker-seminar
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/2025-greaves-filmmaker-semina
 r\n報名/票券: https://blackstarprojects.org/seminar/2027-seminar\n\nTh
 e BlackStar Greaves Seminar is a gathering  artists working in cinematic r
 ealms. The Seminar will take place March 5-7\, 2027 at Stanford University
  in Palo Alto\, CA.\n\nOver the course of three days\, attendees will expl
 ore the technical and creative aspects of media-making\, connect with one 
 another\, and take part in a thoughtful and intimate exchange of ideas. Th
 e Seminar is an opportunity for artists\, scholars\, and filmmakers to cen
 ter their practice while being immersed in the natural beauty of northern 
 California.\n\nThe Seminar is hosted in partnership with the Institute for
  Diversity in the Arts (IDA) at Stanford University.\n\nOur 2027 call for 
 proposals is now open. Curators\, film programmers\, filmmakers\, film wor
 kers\, and film scholars are invited to submit a proposal to present a ses
 sion at the seminar. Learn more and submit by October 5. \n\nGeneral regis
 tration will open in November.\n\nFor questions\, please contact seminar@b
 lackstarprojects.org.
END:VEVENT
