 urses Contact Hours (6.50 hours)\, Non-Physician Participation Credit (6.5
 0 hours)\n\nTarget AudienceSpecialties - Cardiology\, Cardiovascular Healt
 h\, ElectrophysiologyProfessions - Fellow/Resident\, Non-Physician\, Nurse
 \, Physician\, Registered Nurse (RN)\, Student ObjectivesAt the conclusion
  of this activity\, learners should be able to:\n1. Outline current eviden
 ce regarding the basic mechanisms of arrhythmia and emerging therapi
END:VEVENT
