DTEND:20270508T210000Z
SUMMARY:[現場] Public Tour | A Closer Look
LOCATION:Cantor Arts Center
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/public-tour-a-closer-look
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/public-tour-a-closer-look\n\n
 Discover new details\, perspectives\, and connections with Cantor’s “A
  Closer Look” tours. Led by a Stanford Student Guide or volunteer Museum
  Engagement Guide\, each tour focuses on three to four artworks organized 
 around a theme\, providing participants with opportunities for contemplati
 on and conversation.\n\nFirst come\, first served. Tours do not require a 
 reservation and are free of charge. The tour will last between 45 minutes 
 and an hour\, depending on the flow of conversation! Please check in at th
 e visitor services desk* in the main museum lobby.\n\n*If you plan to brin
 g a large group with you (10 people or more)\, please notify us one week i
 n advance via this form so we can inform our Guides. Thank you!
END:VEVENT
