SUMMARY:[現場] Public Tour | A Closer Look
LOCATION:Cantor Arts Center
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/copy-of-public-tour-a-closer-look
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/copy-of-public-tour-a-closer-
 look\n\nDiscover new details\, perspectives\, and connections with Cantor
 ’s “A Closer Look” tours. Led by a Stanford Student Guide or volunte
 er Museum Engagement Guide\, each tour focuses on three to four artworks o
 rganized around a theme\, providing participants with opportunities for co
 ntemplation and conversation.\n\nFirst come\, first served. Tours do not r
 equire a reservation and are free of charge. The tour will last between 45
  minutes and an hour\, depending on the flow of conversation! Please check
  in at the visitor services desk* in the main museum lobby.\n\n*If you pla
 n to bring a large group with you (10 people or more)\, please notify us o
 ne week in advance via this form so we can inform our Guides. Thank you!
END:VEVENT
