 ary ways. Just as intimate as it is epic\, Angels in America\, Part One: M
 illennium Approaches blends raw emotion\, political history\, queer identi
 ty\, love\, loss\, fantasy\, and\, of course\, angels. Relationships fract
 ure and bloom as characters confront illness\, abandonment\, ambition\, an
