URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/medicine-grand-rounds-with-emmanuel-m
 ignot
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/medicine-grand-rounds-with-em
 manuel-mignot\n線上資訊:\nAccess dial in details at https://medicine.
 stanford.edu/education/grand-rounds.html\n\nStanford Department of Medicin
 e would like to invite all Stanford community members to attend this insta
 nce of the Medicine Grand Rounds (MGR) series\, which will feature Emmanue
 l Mignot\, MD\, PhD\, a Stanford sleep medicine pioneer who discovered tha
 t narcolepsy is caused by an immune-mediated loss of brain cells — work 
 that earned him a 2023 Breakthrough Prize in Life Sciences and the 2026 Al
 bert Lasker Basic Medical Research Award.\n\nCE accreditation info here.\n
 \nCME Activity ID: 58647\n\nMOC Credit (1): Complete this form after each 
 session\; reflective statement (1-2 sentences) required.
END:VEVENT
