 aron-inouye-md-mph\n線上資訊:\nAccess dial in details at https://medi
 cine.stanford.edu/education/grand-rounds.html\n\nStanford Department of Me
 dicine would like to invite all Stanford community members to attend this 
 instance of the Medicine Grand Rounds (MGR) series\, which will feature Sh
 aron Inouye\, MD\, MPH\, a Harvard geriatrician and Editor-in-Chief of JAM
