URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/2027-global-health-fall-kickoff
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/2027-global-health-fall-kicko
 ff\n\nOctober 27\, 2026 | 4:30-6:00pm | Alway Courtyard\, Stanford School 
 of Medicine\n\n*For Stanford affiliates and supporters\n\nThis event hoste
 d by the Stanford Center for Innovation in Global Health will bring togeth
 er the Stanford Global Health community including students\, staff\, postd
 ocs\, medical trainees\, faculty\, and community supporters to celebrate t
 he upcoming year. This is a great chance to reconnect with old friends of 
 the center and meet new additions to our community. You will also learn ab
 out exciting new initiatives and opportunities in global and planetary hea
 lth.\n\nLocation: Alway Courtyard\n300 Pasteur Dr.\nStanford\, CA 94305\n\
 nLight refreshments will be served.\n\nRegister here
