URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/ai-health-2026
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/ai-health-2026\n報名/票券
 : https://medhub.stanford.edu/event/aihealth2026/summary\n\nOverview\nStan
 ford University’s 6th annual AI+HEALTH online conference brings together
  leading experts from academia\, industry\, government\, and clinical prac
 tice to examine critical and emerging issues at the intersection of AI and
  health. This large-scale virtual event will feature content tailored to p
 ractitioners\, researchers\, executives\, policymakers\, and professionals
  alike—whether or not they have technical expertise.\n\nRegistrationRegi
 stration will open in September 2026\n\nCreditsAMA PRA Category 1 Credits
 ™ (35.00 hours)\, Non-Physician Participation Credit (35.00 hours)\n\nTa
 rget AudienceSpecialties - Non-clinicalProfessions - Fellow/Resident\, Non
 -Physician\, Physician\, Student ObjectivesAt the conclusion of this activ
 ity\, learners should be able to:\n1. Discuss cutting edge research on art
 ificial intelligence (AI) within healthcare and related domains.\n2. Descr
 ibe AI's actual and potential uses within a broad range of health-related 
 areas.\n3. Implement AI solutions in the delivery of care to patients\n\nA
 ccreditationIn support of improving patient care\, Stanford Medicine is jo
 intly accredited by the Accreditation Council for Continuing Medical Educa
 tion (ACCME)\, the Accreditation Council for Pharmacy Education (ACPE)\, a
 nd the American Nurses Credentialing Center (ANCC)\, to provide continuing
  education for the healthcare team. \n\nCredit Designation \nAmerican Medi
 cal Association (AMA) \nStanford Medicine designates this Live Activity fo
 r a maximum of 17 AMA PRA Category 1 CreditsT
END:VEVENT
