SUMMARY:[混合] HAI Seminar with Angèle Christin in Conversation with Han
 nah Zeavin
LOCATION:Gates Computer Science Building\, 119
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/hai-seminar-with-angele-christin-in-c
 onversation-with-hannah-zeavin
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/hai-seminar-with-angele-chris
 tin-in-conversation-with-hannah-zeavin\n線上連結: https://stanford.zoo
 m.us/webinar/register/WN_oNm5zUqVS5WO0JywL4KyTQ#/registration\n報名/票
 券: https://hai.stanford.edu/events/angele-christin-hannah-zeavin-gurus-h
 ucksters-entertainers-how-influencers-reshaped-social-media\n\nBook Launch
 : “Gurus\, Hucksters\, Entertainers: How Influencers Reshaped Social Med
 ia”\n\nHAI Seminar with Angèle Christin in Conversation with Hannah Zea
 vin\n\nVisit our website to learn more about the event agenda\, speakers\,
  and other details\n\nPlease join us for an illuminating investigation of 
 the complex work of social media content creators—their lives\, conflict
 s\, and controversies. \n\nIn this eye-opening book\, digital studies scho
 lar Angèle Christin demystifies the content creator economy\, explaining 
 its long history and the pitfalls of its professionalization. Drawing on i
 n-depth fieldwork with digital creators as varied as vegan YouTubers\, dad
 s of Instagram\, and self-described drama commentators\, Christin shows ho
 w individuals enter social media creation\, how they make money\, and how 
 their online environments shape their content.
END:VEVENT
