SUMMARY:[混合] Food Sense: What to Eat and Why
LOCATION:Berg Hall
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/medicine-grand-rounds-with-christophe
 r-gardner-phd
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/medicine-grand-rounds-with-ch
 ristopher-gardner-phd\n線上資訊:\nAccess dial in details at https://m
 edicine.stanford.edu/education/grand-rounds.html\n\nStanford Department of
  Medicine would like to invite all Stanford community members to attend th
 is instance of the Medicine Grand Rounds (MGR) series\, which will feature
  Christopher Gardner\, PhD\, a Stanford nutrition scientist who has spent 
 three decades rigorously pitting popular diets against each other to find 
 out what actually works\, and whose twin study became the basis of a Netfl
 ix docuseries watched by millions.\n\nCE accreditation info here.\n\nCME A
 ctivity ID: 58648\n\nMOC Credit (1): Complete this form after each session
 \; reflective statement (1-2 sentences) required.
END:VEVENT
