DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/wind-symphony-fall26\n線上
 連結: music.stanford.edu/wind_symphony_live\n報名/票券: https://live
 .stanford.edu/s/event?EventID=48601\n\nThe Stanford Wind Symphony takes au
 diences on a vibrant musical journey from the ancient streets of Rome in R
 espighi’s evocative I Pini di Roma to the breathtaking landscapes of Yag
 isawa’s Machu Picchu\, alongside the luminous energy of Mackey’s Auror
 a Awakes and the youthful exuberance of Reed’s The Hounds of Spring. The
  program includes Borne’s virtuosic Carmen Fantasy\, featuring Stanford 
 student flutist Erica Wang as soloist\, bringing the brilliance and expres
 sive power of the flute to the concert stage.\n\nAdmission Information\n\n
 General – $37 | Seniors (65+) and Non-Stanford Students – $32\nPrice s
 hown reflects total cost including $4 online/phone per-ticket fee.FREE adm
 ission for Stanford University students. One ticket per ID\, available beg
 inning one hour prior to curtain at the venue.This event will be livestrea
 med.
