SUMMARY:[混合] Another Look presents Tobias Wolff's "Old School"
LOCATION:Stanford Humanities Center\, Levinthal Hall
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/another-look-presents-tobias-wolffs-o
 ld-school
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/another-look-presents-tobias-
 wolffs-old-school\n報名/票券: https://stanford.zoom.us/webinar/registe
 r/WN_wSuJ-_3QTWGKLDxM6yKFtA\n\nPlease join us at 7 p.m. (PST) on Tuesday\,
  November 17\, as we launch our fifteenth season of the Another Look book 
 club.\n\nOur discussion will feature Stanford Prof. Tobias Wolff’s novel
  Old School\, published in 2003. The renowned author is a master of the sh
 ort story and the memoir\, and a celebrated teacher of creative writing. T
 his is his first full-length novel. Our event will also be a celebration o
 f Toby\, the National Medal of Arts winning author who has contributed so 
 much to Stanford and its English/Creative Writing programs over the years.
  For many of us\, he has been a wise teacher and friend as well. \n\nThe h
 ybrid event will take place in Stanford’s Levinthal Hall\, at the Stanfo
 rd Humanities Center at 424 Santa Teresa Street on the Stanford campus. Pa
