 morrisonusha-iyer
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/power-art-practice-with-prof-
 matthew-morrisonusha-iyer\n\nThe Institute for Diversity in the Arts invit
 es you to an open class session of Intro to IDA: Power\, Art\, + Practice 
 featuring Associate Professor in the Department of African and African Ame
 rican Studies\, Matthew Morrison and Associate Professor of Art and Art Hi
 story\, Usha Iyer \n\nToday we engage scholars working across disciplines 
 – theater & performance\, visual art\, music\, and film – in a convers
 ation about their work\, inside and outside of the university\, and how it
  engages with themes: Power\, Art\, + Practice. We will use a version of t
 he Long Table. format\, inspired by the practice of the legendary queer + 
 lesbian performance duo\, Peggy Shaw and Lois Weaver\, known as Split Brit
 ches to shape our discussion.
