LOCATION:Assembly Hall
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/fireside-chat-with-anne-wojcicki-7984
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/fireside-chat-with-anne-wojci
 cki-7984\n線上資訊:\nAccess dial in details at https://medicine.stanf
 ord.edu/education/grand-rounds.html\n\nStanford Department of Medicine wou
 ld like to invite all Stanford community members to attend this instance o
 f the Medicine Grand Rounds (MGR) series\, which will feature Anne Wojcick
 i\, a pioneering force in consumer genomics and personalized medicine who 
 co-founded 23andMe to democratize access to genetic information\, and who 
