 ersity
DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/arts-ai-in-the-evolving-resea
 rch-university\n\nJoin faculty members from Stanford and MIT for presentat
 ions and discussions on centering the arts as a core component of the rese
 arch university's response to paradigm-breaking advances in AI.  How does 
 art engage what most makes us human\, and does AI change the equation? How
  will the arts drive the evolution of higher education that AI demands? Ho
 w will arts integration save research universities from becoming institute
 s of applied AI?\n\n2:00 - 5:45PM\, reception to follow.\n\n \n\nAdditiona
 l details coming soon
