 sation-with-latha-palaniappan\n報名/票券: https://stanforduniversity.q
 ualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_aaa9Vq5s5cyZJ8a\n\nLeading cancer researcher Brya
 nt Lin\, MD\, distills the lessons for living that he’s learned as a phy
 sician and as a patient\, after being diagnosed with his own terminal illn
 ess. He will be joinined by Latha Palaniappan\, MD\, MS\, co-director\, Ce
 nter for Asian Health and Education at Stanford University. \n\nLight lunc
 h provided.
