 xiklSyOVBeZEYa2uCms1HNM9uGzQTe.1\n報名/票券: https://stanford.zoom.us/
 meeting/register/3h1K7lHwQOWl7kVj5gh3jQ\n\nJoin the Anatomical Gift Progra
 m Q&A to learn how anatomical donations advance medical education and surg
 ical training at Stanford. Program staff will outline step-by-step enrollm
 ent procedures\, donor eligibility\, consent and documentation required\, 
